      },
      "suggested_doc_fix": "Replace `transport = httpx.Mounts({...})` and `client = httpx.Client(transport=transport)` with `mounts = {'http://': HTTPSRedirect(), 'https://': httpx.HTTPTransport()}` and `client = httpx.Client(mounts=mounts)`."
